<title>SOUTH AFRICA: NEDCOR'S LAUBSCHER ELECTED COSAB CHAIRMAN.</title>
<headline>NEDCOR'S LAUBSCHER ELECTED COSAB CHAIRMAN.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Council of South African Banks (COSAB) announced on Thursday that Nedcor Bank Ltd's managing director Richard Laubscher had been elected COSAB chairman.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
